<title>USA: GenAmerica Capital I sells $125 mln cap securities.</title>
<headline>GenAmerica Capital I sells $125 mln cap securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144A issue of capital securities from GenAmerica Capital I via A.G. Edwards was priced on Thursday, according to a syndicate source.</p>
<p>GenAmerica is a privately held insurance company.</p>
<p>BORROWER GENAMERICA CAPITAL I</p>
<p>AMT  $125 MLN	COUPON 8.525 PCT  MATURITY 6/30/2027</p>
<p>TYPE CAPTL SECS    ISS PRICE 100     FIRST PAY DATE 12/30/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 8.525 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD 160 BPS    CALLABLE NON CALL 10</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678)</p>
</text>
